==English==
===Etymology===
{{term|ass}} + {{term|wipe}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{vulgar}} An [[annoying]] or [[contemptible]] person, especially if this is their usual [[demeanor]].
#: ''He is such an '''asswipe'''!''
# {{vulgar}} A [[worthless]] person.
# {{UK}} A {{colloquial}} term for [[toilet paper]], especially in the plural form ([[asswipe]]s).
#: ''Pass me the '''asswipes''', John.''